    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d254">

                <pb facs="0227" n="217" sameAs="frus:frus1949v08/pg217"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/3–3149: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Peiping</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Clubb</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Peiping</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-03-31T15:00:00+08:00">March 31, 1949—3
                            p. m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received March 31—4:26 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>526. ReContel 525, March 31. Recommend categorical firm denial allegation New
                    China Agency despite fact identification bombers as American flag B–29 type
                    ambiguous.</p>
                <p>Repeated Nanking and Shanghai.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Clubb</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
